/**
 * Plain English and Czech text for every job, hold, publication, render, edit, approval, account, media, brief and
 * scheduler code the marketing system records (own-dashboard#119). The owner reads what happened and what happens
 * next; the code itself only appears inside a collapsed Details element. Browser-safe: no server module is imported.
 *
 * `tests/lib/marketing-codes.test.ts` fails when a code that the marketing modules emit has no text here, or when
 * a listed code lacks its English or Czech text. A code nobody listed still reads as the generic text below.
 */
